      "description": "🌴🚀 TROPICAL NOMADS returns to Amsterdam! 🚀🌴\n\nAfter an unforgettable first edition, we're back at Toekomstmuziek for a new psychedelic journey — and this time, we're taking things even further.\n\nFor this special edition, Tropical Nomads joins forces once again with our friends from PGP – Psychedelic Grateful Punks, who will host a dedicated second stage, bringing their own unique energy and artists to the experience. 👽🌀\n\nTogether, we're creating a night that celebrates the diversity of the psychedelic scene, combining international artists, local talents, two dancefloors and one united tribe.\n\nExpect powerful Full-On, groovy psychedelic sounds, deeper nighttime journeys and an atmosphere built by people who genuinely love this culture.\n\n📍 Toekomstmuziek – Amsterdam 🇳🇱\n📅 10 July 2026\n🕕 18:00 – 03:00\n🎶 2 Stages\n🌍 International & Local Psytrance Artists\n🌀 Psychedelic Decoration\n🎨 Body Painting\n🛍️ Psychedelic Shop\n🍵 Chai Corner\n\nMore artists, more collaborations, more experiences.\nOne night. Two stages. One tribe. 👽🔥",
      "organizer": "After June",
