      "description": "Join Tropical Groove on July 11 at The Bernard Shaw, Dublin! 2 stages of Psytrance, psychedelic decor, and an epic journey\r\n\r\nGet ready to elevate your frequencies! Tropical Groove is taking over The Bernard Shaw for an unforgettable gathering. We are transforming the venue into a vibrant, neon-drenched psychedelic playground spread across two distinct stages.\r\n\r\nExpect a massive lineup of international and local heavyweights delivering pure psytrance energy, mind-bending UV decor, and an immersive dancefloor odyssey that will keep you moving until dawn. 👽🌴✨\r\n\r\n🗓️ April 25th\r\n📍 The Bernard Shaw, Dublin\r\n👽 2 Stages\r\n⏱️ Over 13h of Party!",
