      "lineupRaw": "UNIVERSE & TROPICAL NOMADS presents\n🔱 BOM SHANKA MUSIC LABEL NIGHT 👽\n\nFor the first time, TROPICAL NOMADS arrives in London, joining forces with UNIVERSE for a special night dedicated to the sound and energy of Bom Shanka Music.\n\nThis edition brings 4 names from the Bom Shanka family, including BOCARA 🇧🇷, coming directly from Brazil, alongside ABIOTIQ 🇫🇷, DIRTY, SAFFI 🇬🇧 and NUKY 🇬🇧 — a lineup built for a proper psychedelic journey, from deep grooves to full-power dancefloor moments. 🔥\n\nThe night also features 3RD VISION 🇧🇷, AFTER JUNE 🇧🇷, BLAZIN’G 🇧🇷 and SHIVAION 🇧🇷, connecting the Brazilian psychedelic force with the London scene.\n\nExpect almost 9 hours of psytrance, international artists, heavy sound, psychedelic atmosphere and a dancefloor ready to move from the first beat until the morning. 🌀\n\nLondon, this is the first one — and we’re coming properly. 🤯",
