      "description": "Tropical Nomads lands in Amsterdam for the first time with psytrance legend Burn in Noise — followed by a special PGP afterparty.\n\n🔥 Burn in Noise comes to Amsterdam! 🔥\n\nOne of the biggest and most respected names in the global psytrance scene, Burn in Noise 🇧🇷 has been dominating dancefloors worldwide with his explosive energy, powerful grooves and unmistakable sound — performing at some of the biggest festivals and parties across the globe. 🌍✨\n\nFor the first time ever, Tropical Nomads lands in Amsterdam 🇳🇱, joining forces with PGP – Psychedelic Grateful Punks to create a massive psychedelic gathering.\n\nThis special edition will take place at Toekomstmuziek, one of Amsterdam’s most iconic underground venues.\n\nExpect a full psychedelic experience featuring international artists, immersive decoration, body painting, psychedelic shop, and a dancefloor filled with pure energy and connection. 🌀\n\nThe main event runs from 18:00 to 03:00, followed by an official afterparty hosted by Psychedelic Grateful Punks from 03:00 until 12:00.\n\nThat’s 18 hours of music, community and psychedelic celebration. 🌈\n\n📅 Save the date — more details and full lineup coming soon.\n\n📍 Venue: Toekomstmuziek – Amsterdam 🇳🇱\n📅 29th May, 2026\n🕕 Main Event: 18:00 – 03:00\n🌅 Official Afterparty by PGP: 03:00 – 12:00\n🎶 18 Hours of Music\n🌍 International Psytrance Artists\n🌀 Psychedelic Decoration by SHIVA SHAKTI\n🎨 Body Painting\n🛍️ Psychedelic Shop \n💃 Dancefloor Journey Until Sunrise",
      "organizer": "After June",
      "images": {
