      "description": "Tropical Nomads Berlin lands at M-Bia on November 29th with two explosive stages — one dedicated to driving Psytrance and the other to intense Dark & Hitech vibes.\r\n\r\nFlying in directly from Brazil, AVAN7, DIGITALK, KARELL and DJ PAULA lead this gathering, joined by a strong lineup of Brazilian talents now based in Europe, alongside local and international friends.\r\n\r\nThis event is a celebration of music, unity and connection — a safe space where dancers from all backgrounds come together until sunrise.\r\n\r\nMore info\r\n► 2 floors: Psytrance & Dark/Hitech\r\n► 14 Artists\r\n► Funktion-One sound system\r\n► Psychedelic decoration\r\n► Good vibes",
