      "description": "🎃👻 Tropical Groove Pre Halloween 2025 👻🎃\n\nOn October 25th, 2025, The Bernard Shaw becomes the stage for an unforgettable Halloween marathon!\nThree crews unite – MaaD Houz, Tropical Nomads & Psy Groove – bringing you a triple journey of music and art across three dance floors and hours of non-stop celebration.\n\n🕑 Schedule\n✨ Daytime Gathering → 2pm – 10pm → Free Entry\n🌙 Night Ritual → 10pm – 3am\n• 🎟️ 1st Release: €12\n• 🎟️ 2nd Release: €15\n• 🎟️ 3rd Release: €17\n• 🎟️ Door: €20\n\n🔊 Main Styles: Psytrance, Tech House & Techno\n🎨 Bodypainting, handmade jewelry stands & many more surprises await!\n\nPrepare yourself for a psychedelic, dark and powerful night, with immersive music, vibrant art and a community vibe that will keep you dancing till the very end.\n\n👻 Dress code: peace & love vibes only.\n📍 Location: @thebernardshaw – Dublin",
